      "options": ["At her own place", "In the same café", "With Oleg", "She is not having dinner"],
      "answer": 0 },
    { "ask": "Which of them is eating right now?",
      "options": ["Anya", "Oleg", "Both of them", "Neither"], "answer": 0 }
   ]
